   "en": "The ⟦0⟧ is a landlocked minor country in Central Europe with a population of ⟦1⟧. It borders ⟦2⟧ to the west and north, ⟦3⟧ to northeast, and ⟦4⟧, ⟦5⟧ and ⟦6⟧ to the south. Czechoslovakia is in a precarious position, being a small democratic country surrounded by powerful potential enemies while enjoying only token protection by the erstwhile Allied Powers of France and the United Kingdom, who both prioritize maintaining peace with Germany over guaranteeing Czechoslovakian sovereignty.",
